{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y把X中不少细微的音乐变化、身体感受和心理转折压缩成了概括性短词，尤其后半段的情绪层次和音乐细节有所损失。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的左右分工比较稳定，左边完整讲述人物经历，右边补充音乐感受，观众更容易在听音乐时快速找到叙事主线，前后也更像一段连贯的心理历程。X的【】突出重点很有效，而且对人物矛盾和音乐细节的描写更细腻，能让人理解他为什么舍不得、为什么不愿回头；但部分短时段信息密度偏高。综合实际观看时的扫读负担和故事连贯性，我选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e9ce47bb-4fc5-4249-809d-b0fe7b497b1a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T182052879497Z", "elapsed_seconds": 137.188, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T18:23:10.078219+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e84dab44567017bac9a2b480b7243475028562d6ad47a180635c66988834e43d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa